  clock: 3  # 9ab5
  nonce: 9ab5  # 9ab5
  message: "PREMISE AUDIT 2026-10-03 (owner-requested; read-only, reproduced at dev 3abedae588 on small fixtures). PARTLY STALE, one MIS-PREMISED example. Title widened.\n- GAP CONFIRMED, JS AND TS: js_ts.py:5503-5650, the bare-identifier arm, emits nothing when import disambiguation, same-package match, resolver, named import and JS_KNOWN_GLOBAL_CALLS all miss. Repro across .js/.mjs/.cjs/.jsx/.ts/.tsx: join(p,'x'), readFileSync(p), normalize(p) produce no edge in any. Python control: undefined_thing(p) emits python:external:0-0:undefined_thing. JS_BUILTIN_NAMES members (parseInt) and parameter-shadowed names are also silent.\n- MIS-PREMISED: const {readFile} = require('fs/promises'); readFile(p) ALREADY emits javascript:fs/promises:0-0:readFile. CommonJS destructuring has been in named_imports since 8f11136fb9 (WI-zavad, 2026-06-19).\n- THE REAL RECALL INSTANCE: a called ESM DEFAULT import, import exec from 'child_process'; exec(p) and import def from 'lib'; def(p), emits nothing.\n- ADR-0017 mechanism confirmed: a missing callees_at entry becomes an escape site (taint.py ~4479, ~4586/4629).\n- Same arm, separate defect, filed today as WI-sofuh: a bare call to a function the caller's own file declares binds to another file's same-name function at 0.85."  # 9ab5
