  message: "BRANCH WORK 2026-10-03 (not integrated, no status change): branch jgstern-agent/fix/sofuh, worktree ~/hg_wt/sofuh, commits 4b50aaba1a f09e820bf8 6eae9b63d6 76bd663bfd 5328479c58. smart-test (326 affected files): 10340 passed, 0 failed, 2 xfailed, mypy ratchet clean, changed sources at 100% coverage. Full report: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/sofuh.md.\nFix (4b50aaba1a, same arm as WI-sofuh): an unbound, unimported, repo-absent bare name emits javascript:external:0-0:<name>:unresolved; a called module binding emits <module>:0-0:default (import exec from 'child_process'; exec(p) names child_process.default, deliberately not .exec -- a TypeError in Node, not a recall instance). Calls through a parameter/local value stay refused (python's LEGB rule). Findings A/B, generic taint claims on hls.js/nest/Tone.js/dash.js: 28/28 verdicts and all flow sets unchanged, 0 sanitized both arms, 0 io tags added. Hazard measured on a fixture only: the external slot short-name-matches function rows (unimported readFileSync tags fs_read) -- filed WI-javaf-nisih-zijif-marug-gorul-niduf-momos-rajuk. Other silent callee shapes: WI-gutup-mizoj-gatap-vizij-vofip-dogum-gunat-noluh."  # 1be5
