  message: "Merged in PR #1445 (dev 65b9729da7).\n\nFixed in PR #1445 (4b50aaba1a), in the same bare-identifier arm as WI-sofuh. Behavioral evidence, the filed repro re-run on the branch: `function bareUnresolvedNames(p){ join(p,'x'); readFileSync(p); normalize(p) }` now emits `javascript:external:0-0:{join,readFileSync,normalize}:unresolved` in .js/.mjs/.cjs/.jsx/.ts/.tsx (was: zero edges). A called module binding emits its default export (`import def from 'lib'; def(p)` -> `javascript:lib:0-0:default:unresolved`; `import exec from 'child_process'` -> `child_process.default`, deliberately NOT child_process.exec). Production-path tests: TestUnboundNamesAreRecorded. Findings A/B (generic taint claims, hls.js / nest / Tone.js / dash.js): 28 of 28 verdicts and every flow set unchanged, 0 sanitized in both arms, 0 io tags added. STILL REFUSED: a call through a parameter or local value (python's LEGB rule). The residual's short-name catalogue reach (an unimported `readFileSync` tags fs_read on a fixture) is filed as WI-javaf. Other silent callee shapes are filed as WI-gutup.\n\n---"  # 2dc6
